Rule 10 (Input tensor dimension 1 (channel) should be greater than 0)
{v_1: tensor} |= shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_1) > 1
>>
Rule 11 (The output tensor's dtype is same as input tensor's dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
